WEBVTT

00:00.927 --> 00:07.599
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.927 --> 00:07.599
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.663 --> 00:14.690
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.663 --> 00:14.690
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.275 --> 00:21.947
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.275 --> 00:21.947
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.972 --> 00:28.186
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.972 --> 00:28.186
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.080 --> 00:34.752
This surging power...

00:29.080 --> 00:34.752
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.080 --> 00:31.167
Black Jack

00:36.254 --> 00:42.509
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.254 --> 00:42.509
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.303 --> 00:48.265
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.303 --> 00:48.265
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.836 --> 00:57.191
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.836 --> 00:57.191
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.692 --> 00:59.383
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.383 --> 01:01.376
will be there

01:01.396 --> 01:04.356
It makes me glad...

01:01.396 --> 01:04.356
yokatta

01:04.601 --> 01:12.081
That I found my place here.

01:04.601 --> 01:12.081
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.134 --> 01:13.652
Oh WISDOM

01:13.652 --> 01:15.501
will be there

01:15.529 --> 01:18.170
I searched for the reason

01:15.529 --> 01:18.170
sagashita

01:18.171 --> 01:25.219
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.171 --> 01:25.219
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.804 --> 01:32.684
as long as we're alive.

01:25.804 --> 01:32.684
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.685 --> 01:34.770
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.854 --> 01:37.038
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.190 --> 01:39.801
His name is Black Jack.

02:01.609 --> 02:08.823
When I walk east, the wind blows.

02:08.824 --> 02:20.668
When I walk west, it rains.

02:21.587 --> 02:24.839
You must be a surgeon.

02:26.258 --> 02:28.112
Can you even see?

02:28.677 --> 02:33.327
I just sensed the smell of disinfectant and blood.

02:33.766 --> 02:37.185
Blind men have a good sense of smell.

02:37.564 --> 02:42.339
And you have quite a few scalpels
under your cloak, don't you?

02:43.108 --> 02:46.319
You like cutting people, huh?

02:46.320 --> 02:48.613
You're a demon of surgery.

02:51.200 --> 02:52.617
It's none of your business.

02:53.452 --> 02:56.579
Stop relying on surgery, medicine, and the like.

02:56.997 --> 02:58.870
They're all stupid.

02:59.792 --> 03:02.710
Surgery is stupid? is that what you just said?

03:02.711 --> 03:03.544
Yeah.

03:03.545 --> 03:04.337
Why?

03:04.546 --> 03:09.634
Bodies were not originally made to be cut and stitched.

03:10.219 --> 03:12.303
Look at the wild beasts.

03:12.680 --> 03:15.823
They don't have an operation when they get sick.

03:16.141 --> 03:18.935
They let nature heal them.

03:18.936 --> 03:20.645
Yeah.

03:21.438 --> 03:22.140
Wait.

03:22.523 --> 03:24.107
Tell me your name.

03:26.235 --> 03:28.446
I'm an acupuncturist, Biwamaru.

03:30.656 --> 03:31.864
Biwamaru...

03:40.350 --> 03:43.561
Originally "The Blind Acupuncturist" by Tezuka Osamu

03:40.350 --> 03:43.561
The Blind Doctor of Rumor

03:49.318 --> 03:50.526
Yes?

03:51.403 --> 03:54.238
Oh, Doctor! The thing is... Well...

04:02.206 --> 04:04.156
How did he get such an appetite?

04:04.625 --> 04:08.085
A man named Biwamaru stopped by a few moments ago.

04:08.086 --> 04:08.836
Biwamaru?

04:09.173 --> 04:13.549
Yes, Biwamaru poked him with a needle.

04:14.885 --> 04:21.057
Right after that, he got up and started eating.

04:21.058 --> 04:22.475
How can that be?!

04:22.476 --> 04:25.735
He shouldn't be able to eat without an operation.

04:26.021 --> 04:29.127
But; as you can see, he's eating!

04:46.500 --> 04:48.334
You seem to be doing well.

04:48.335 --> 04:50.670
You've been saying that your shoulder is always stiff.

04:51.397 --> 04:52.797
Oh, this?

04:53.131 --> 04:56.091
The thing is, I ran into a weird man yesterday.

04:56.264 --> 04:57.417
A weird man?

04:57.511 --> 04:58.196
Yeah.

04:58.220 --> 05:00.263
I was waiting for a train at the station,

05:00.387 --> 05:03.933
and that's when he approached me, sniffing all the while.

05:08.272 --> 05:10.751
Does your arm hurt?

05:10.838 --> 05:11.918
How could you tell?

05:11.942 --> 05:15.653
I just sensed the smell of illness.

05:16.198 --> 05:17.511
Whatever...

05:17.692 --> 05:19.133
What did he do then?

05:19.225 --> 05:21.325
He took out a needle,

05:21.994 --> 05:24.764
took my hand, and...

05:28.125 --> 05:29.709
l didn't know how it'd turn out,

05:30.043 --> 05:33.713
but when I woke up this morning,
this arm felt much lighter.

05:34.590 --> 05:38.009
I've heard about it before,
but that was my first experience with acupuncture.

05:38.010 --> 05:39.677
It actually works, huh?

05:39.678 --> 05:42.138
A needle? He cures people with just a needle?

05:42.628 --> 05:43.628
Yeah.

05:43.849 --> 05:45.141
And furthermore...

05:45.449 --> 05:48.932
You've had an operation on these fingers, haven't you?

05:49.062 --> 05:51.314
You can even tell that?

05:51.315 --> 05:53.036
Sure can.

05:53.525 --> 05:57.778
You shouldn't rely on operations so much.

05:58.196 --> 06:01.157
Operations are evil.

06:06.246 --> 06:07.914
H-Hey, what's your name?

06:07.915 --> 06:10.575
Nothing worth mentioning.

06:10.834 --> 06:12.330
But what about the fee?

06:17.758 --> 06:19.443
He sounds pretty cool

06:21.149 --> 06:24.096
That's not cool at all.

06:24.097 --> 06:27.558
My Doc is much, much cooler!

06:27.559 --> 06:29.977
Hey, don't get so upset.

06:29.978 --> 06:33.022
How can I not be upset?!

06:33.023 --> 06:36.150
Telling people not to have operations is going too far!

06:36.594 --> 06:37.714
Pinoco-chan...

06:37.914 --> 06:39.493
Oh man...

06:49.039 --> 06:50.122
I sense it...

06:50.123 --> 06:53.751
I sense the smell of illness.

07:00.217 --> 07:00.981
Yes?

07:02.469 --> 07:05.221
Yes. Hello.

07:05.222 --> 07:07.556
W-Who are you?!

07:07.557 --> 07:11.519
Me? I'm a doctor.

07:11.520 --> 07:12.692
Doctor?

07:13.021 --> 07:15.439
More precisely, an acupuncturist.

07:15.440 --> 07:17.108
Now, excuse me.

07:17.109 --> 07:17.936
Hey!

07:18.860 --> 07:20.903
I didn't ask for a doctor!

07:20.904 --> 07:22.863
Besides, we don't have any money to pay you!

07:22.864 --> 07:25.825
That's fine. I don't need money.

07:26.206 --> 07:26.895
Um...

07:26.919 --> 07:28.483
Do not worry.

07:28.892 --> 07:30.651
Let me examine you.

07:30.936 --> 07:32.748
Who are you?!

07:32.749 --> 07:34.083
Don't touch my mom!

07:34.084 --> 07:35.126
I'll call the police!

07:35.127 --> 07:36.069
Shh...

07:37.337 --> 07:41.090
You have a serious blood disease.

07:42.384 --> 07:45.052
You aren't seeing a doctor?

07:45.388 --> 07:46.345
N-No...

07:46.346 --> 07:49.223
We don't have any money to pay one!

07:50.142 --> 07:52.018
Let's see. For this one,

07:52.791 --> 07:55.418
let's use the 4 iron.

07:55.981 --> 07:56.981
Hey!

07:56.982 --> 07:58.357
What are you going to do?

07:58.358 --> 08:00.109
Don't worry.

08:00.110 --> 08:02.111
l'll just use one needle on you.

08:02.112 --> 08:02.911
Stop!

08:04.656 --> 08:06.490
Don't move.

08:06.491 --> 08:08.868
It'll just take a minute.

08:10.037 --> 08:11.829
Stay still!

08:24.064 --> 08:26.927
That should do it.

08:27.387 --> 08:29.638
Now you'll get better.

08:29.639 --> 08:32.558
You'll be all better in four or five days.

08:32.872 --> 08:33.976
R-Really?

08:33.977 --> 08:35.122
Then...

08:37.147 --> 08:39.588
We really don't have to pay?

08:40.942 --> 08:42.318
Bugs...

08:42.319 --> 08:45.446
Any bugs of sickness around?

08:48.366 --> 08:53.287
Acupuncture is a technique for stimulating
an acupuncture point, or meridian point,

08:53.288 --> 08:55.956
using a needle.

08:55.957 --> 08:58.709
It's effective against aches, pains,

08:58.710 --> 09:01.712
It originated in China.

09:01.962 --> 09:06.634
You can also use acupuncture instead of
chemical anesthetics during surgery.

09:07.219 --> 09:11.597
Acupuncture is less taxing on the patient
and results in faster recovery.

09:11.598 --> 09:16.310
Some even go so far as to say that
it's more effective than surgery.

09:16.937 --> 09:19.605
Don't lie!

09:19.606 --> 09:22.900
My Doc's operations are the best!

09:22.901 --> 09:24.151
Sheesh!

09:24.152 --> 09:26.153
Pinoco, what are you yelling about?

09:26.154 --> 09:29.365
Doc, does acupuncture work better than operations?

09:29.517 --> 09:30.468
Why are you asking that all of a sudden?

09:30.492 --> 09:33.869
The acupuncture guy who treated the
hand of the owner of Tom's said,

09:34.135 --> 09:36.372
"Don't rely on operations!"

09:37.249 --> 09:38.791
Acupuncturist?

09:45.173 --> 09:47.424
Could it be him?

09:50.335 --> 09:53.430
B-But he has an ailing stomach.

09:53.431 --> 09:55.099
I Know.

09:59.146 --> 10:01.063
That should do it.

10:02.566 --> 10:04.815
Will he really get better now?

10:04.977 --> 10:07.860
You'll see in four or five days.

10:08.738 --> 10:11.153
Now, please excuse me.

10:25.225 --> 10:26.073
Oh.

10:27.841 --> 10:31.594
Are you here to see me, Dr. Surgeon?

10:31.595 --> 10:34.138
Yeah, I wanted to tell you something.

10:34.139 --> 10:35.181
Me?.

10:35.413 --> 10:37.975
Hm, what is it?

10:37.976 --> 10:41.645
I have no interest in whom you stab
with your needle, or where,

10:42.028 --> 10:45.566
but I forbid you to get involved with my patients.

10:46.610 --> 10:48.944
Me? Your patients?

10:48.945 --> 10:49.612
Yes.

10:49.613 --> 10:52.072
I didn't mean to.

10:52.073 --> 10:54.151
Sorry about that.

10:54.367 --> 10:58.763
But it's helping ill people get better,
so what's wrong with that?

10:59.206 --> 11:05.002
I'm only going to places this nose is telling me to go.

11:05.265 --> 11:10.216
If you're worried, get to the patients faster than I do.

11:12.969 --> 11:16.597
With this gust comes another illness.

11:16.598 --> 11:19.612
Excuse me, Doctor.

11:22.229 --> 11:26.440
Doctor! My old man was stricken with a palsy!

11:26.441 --> 11:28.192
Doctor! Please treat my boy's leg!

11:28.193 --> 11:30.361
Please save him!

11:30.362 --> 11:32.196
My grandmother can't get up!

11:32.197 --> 11:33.152
Dr. Biwamaru,

11:34.407 --> 11:37.076
we heard that you treat all kinds of
different people with your needles.

11:37.494 --> 11:39.078
Why do you do it?

11:42.457 --> 11:45.042
And is it true that you don't ask for money?

11:46.947 --> 11:47.947
Man...

11:48.421 --> 11:51.715
Can you at least give us a word?

11:54.454 --> 11:57.101
A word...

11:57.806 --> 11:59.419
Excuse me.

12:00.834 --> 12:01.834
Doctor!

12:03.103 --> 12:06.105
Doctor, thank you for making my mom better.

12:06.106 --> 12:07.064
This is from her.

12:08.275 --> 12:10.859
Sorry, but this is all we've got.

12:11.319 --> 12:13.195
I can't take the money.

12:13.196 --> 12:15.698
I'm not that desperate for it.

12:16.241 --> 12:17.324
You sure?

12:17.325 --> 12:19.493
Doctor, please come to my place!.

12:19.494 --> 12:21.036
Wait for your turn.

12:21.037 --> 12:24.331
I sense the smell of a more serious illness.

12:24.332 --> 12:27.042
That one's first.

12:28.135 --> 12:29.063
Smell?

12:29.087 --> 12:31.672
He said that he can sense the smell of illness.

12:33.633 --> 12:36.430
Smell of illness, huh?

12:51.192 --> 12:54.528
Stinks like a disease. Stinks like a disease.

12:54.529 --> 12:55.779
I sense it.

12:55.780 --> 12:59.992
I sense the smell of illness.

13:13.147 --> 13:13.674
Yes?

13:15.800 --> 13:16.884
Who are you?

13:17.213 --> 13:19.970
You have a sick one inside, don't you?

13:20.347 --> 13:22.556
Let me enter.

13:22.599 --> 13:23.307
Um...

13:23.350 --> 13:26.310
Don't you worry,

13:29.856 --> 13:32.858
You must be the sick one.

13:32.859 --> 13:34.693
Who are you?

13:34.880 --> 13:36.487
I'm a doctor.

13:36.488 --> 13:38.739
I came here to make you well.

13:38.740 --> 13:39.698
Doctor?.

13:39.699 --> 13:45.120
B-But she's scheduled to have an operation
with Dr. Black Jack tormorrow.

13:45.121 --> 13:46.372
Operation?

13:46.373 --> 13:48.374
You shouldn't something like that.

13:48.375 --> 13:49.666
But he's...

13:49.667 --> 13:51.126
You still shouldn't.

13:51.127 --> 13:53.629
Let me take care of it...

13:53.630 --> 13:55.631
with this.

14:05.649 --> 14:06.829
Coming!

14:09.312 --> 14:10.261
Hello?

14:10.522 --> 14:12.929
Yes, it's Doc's place.

14:13.316 --> 14:14.525
Acupuncture?

14:14.762 --> 14:17.319
We don't offer acupuncture treatment!

14:17.320 --> 14:19.196
We only handle surgery!

14:19.906 --> 14:20.641
Who?!

14:21.366 --> 14:22.533
Biwamaru?!

14:22.534 --> 14:24.271
Who in the world is that?!

14:24.391 --> 14:26.328
There's only Doc here!

14:26.329 --> 14:27.413
Oh?

14:28.289 --> 14:29.540
This is Black Jack.

14:31.251 --> 14:32.494
What?!

14:34.629 --> 14:38.006
A man barged in and used a needle on her?

14:41.553 --> 14:43.971
D-Doc!

14:43.972 --> 14:45.431
What a crook.

14:45.432 --> 14:47.349
He's conceited beyond belief.

15:02.512 --> 15:03.275
Hold it right there!

15:04.617 --> 15:07.209
Biwamaru, why did you treat my patient?

15:07.454 --> 15:08.787
Oh, it's you.

15:09.205 --> 15:11.748
I told you that you're not allowed
to touch any of my patients.

15:11.975 --> 15:14.126
Don't get so mad.

15:14.127 --> 15:16.712
Like I said, I'm healing sick people.

15:16.873 --> 15:19.506
That shouldn't be anything bad.

15:19.507 --> 15:21.425
But it doesn't work like that.

15:21.778 --> 15:24.298
That patient has something called
myasthenia gravis.

15:24.725 --> 15:27.272
I was going to remove her
thymus gland tomorrow.

15:28.099 --> 15:30.044
I wanted to let her rest until then.

15:30.345 --> 15:32.395
Sorry if I upset you,

15:32.516 --> 15:35.161
but you are so hard-headed.

15:35.927 --> 15:36.669
Wait!

15:39.235 --> 15:40.819
I'm not done talking to you yet.

15:42.363 --> 15:46.283
How many people have you treated with your needles?

15:46.826 --> 15:49.614
Two or three thousand, I think.

15:49.996 --> 15:51.373
That's all?

15:52.332 --> 15:55.459
And you haven't made any mistakes?

15:56.419 --> 15:59.463
Of course not.

15:59.464 --> 16:03.175
Then perhaps this is your first one!

16:04.219 --> 16:04.801
Come with me!

16:04.928 --> 16:07.596
What, all of a sudden?!

16:07.639 --> 16:08.514
What are you doing?

16:08.515 --> 16:10.098
Just come!

16:16.525 --> 16:17.208
Doctor!

16:17.232 --> 16:18.273
Doctor, my daughter is...

16:18.274 --> 16:19.733
It's okay. I know.

16:29.786 --> 16:31.537
Exactly as I thought.

16:32.080 --> 16:34.164
Ma'am, please get me a cup with a spout.

16:34.165 --> 16:35.230
Y-Yes.

16:37.710 --> 16:40.295
Here, drink this slowly.

16:42.340 --> 16:45.008
Shortly after she had the needle treatment,

16:45.009 --> 16:47.050
she suddenly started to suffer.

16:47.387 --> 16:48.428
Then she started experiencing cramps.

16:51.057 --> 16:52.766
I gave her a sedative.

16:52.767 --> 16:54.217
That should settle her down.

16:56.271 --> 16:58.605
We should still keep an eye on her though.

16:58.606 --> 17:01.382
I know I had the right point...

17:01.651 --> 17:03.735
No, it's not a matter of the acupuncture point.

17:04.737 --> 17:08.407
She gets this way because she has a fear of needles.

17:08.866 --> 17:10.200
Fear?

17:10.212 --> 17:10.785
Yes.

17:13.165 --> 17:14.845
It's an anxiety neurosis.

17:15.415 --> 17:19.626
When her last doctor gave her an
intravenous shot, it was very painful.

17:20.096 --> 17:24.158
Ever since then, she's displayed an adverse
reaction every time she sees a needle.

17:24.754 --> 17:27.909
That's why I've avoided all shots,

17:28.177 --> 17:30.929
and have been treating her with oral medication.

17:32.557 --> 17:35.684
Treating children comes with many restrictions.

17:37.228 --> 17:40.173
No matter how much you oppose surgery,

17:40.898 --> 17:43.765
you should at least have called me.

17:48.072 --> 17:49.722
Thank you.

17:50.074 --> 17:51.794
She should be all right now.

17:52.243 --> 17:55.370
I will reschedule the operation for a later date.

17:55.913 --> 17:58.612
Please call me if anything changes.

17:58.916 --> 17:59.565
Now then.

18:00.001 --> 18:01.991
Thank you so much.

18:03.296 --> 18:06.298
Now I owe you one.

18:06.841 --> 18:10.996
Until today, I thought acupuncture
was perfect for everything.

18:11.346 --> 18:13.932
You do have a great skill,

18:14.558 --> 18:19.278
but I don't like people like you who flaunt their charity.

18:26.486 --> 18:30.113
I'd usually offer a ride, but I won't.

18:30.573 --> 18:31.865
That's fine.

18:31.866 --> 18:36.411
If I accept any more favors, I'll worry so
much that I won't be able to sleep.

18:36.412 --> 18:37.851
Anyway, take care.

19:20.654 --> 19:23.121
What's going on so late at night?

19:26.093 --> 19:26.726
Who's there?

19:31.801 --> 19:32.815
You're...

19:36.973 --> 19:39.683
Excuse my late visit.

19:39.684 --> 19:42.018
You came all the way here in the dark?

19:42.019 --> 19:46.106
It's easier for me after dark.

19:46.107 --> 19:47.023
What do you want?

19:47.024 --> 19:50.235
I just couldn't sleep,

19:50.236 --> 19:54.156
so I thought I'd return the favor from earlier today.

19:54.157 --> 19:55.449
Are you kidding me?!

19:55.450 --> 19:56.900
What time do you think-

19:59.078 --> 20:00.162
H-Hey!

20:00.163 --> 20:03.425
Now, excuse me.

20:04.667 --> 20:06.197
How rude.

20:07.295 --> 20:09.504
Now...

20:13.468 --> 20:16.178
Here, lay down.

20:16.179 --> 20:18.180
Lay down? Me?

20:18.181 --> 20:20.932
Who else is here?

20:20.933 --> 20:21.600
Hey!

20:25.062 --> 20:26.480
What are you doing?!

20:27.315 --> 20:29.733
Don't you worry.

20:29.734 --> 20:34.237
I'm just giving you one needle.

20:47.210 --> 20:49.419
That should do it.

20:50.004 --> 20:52.297
What's that for?

20:52.298 --> 20:55.926
I sensed that you have intestinal problems.

20:56.427 --> 20:59.491
They've been cut many times, haven't they?

20:59.722 --> 21:00.931
Y-Yeah.

21:00.932 --> 21:04.829
Now your intestines will be fine for the rest of your life.

21:08.397 --> 21:11.775
I can't eat any more...

21:12.443 --> 21:13.860
Ta-Ta.

21:13.861 --> 21:16.238
We'll meet again if we're so destined.

21:16.697 --> 21:18.646
Come here if you ever get hurt.

21:18.950 --> 21:20.200
I'll operate on you.

21:20.618 --> 21:22.202
I'll make it cheap.

21:22.203 --> 21:23.495
Thanks.

21:23.496 --> 21:25.705
But there's no need for that.

21:26.040 --> 21:30.168
I have my own needles.

21:31.420 --> 21:32.963
You're so stubborn.

21:33.198 --> 21:35.549
You too.

21:38.386 --> 21:43.849
When I walk east, the wind blows.

21:43.850 --> 21:49.565
When I walk west, it rains.

21:49.939 --> 21:55.819
The capricious wind carries my smell.

21:56.353 --> 22:02.076
Now, open a path for me.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
Only look straight at me.

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.917 --> 22:57.300
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.917 --> 22:53.122
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.577 --> 22:57.301
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.045 --> 23:43.930
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.045 --> 23:36.978
sora no hate tooku

23:37.071 --> 23:43.871
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.054 --> 24:15.006
The Witness of a Brief Moment

23:49.247 --> 23:50.454
Something exploded!

23:50.567 --> 23:51.774
Exploded?!

23:51.881 --> 23:53.728
Make sure to list all suspects!

23:53.880 --> 23:54.961
I saw him.

23:55.114 --> 23:56.854
I have four suspects in custody.

23:56.867 --> 23:58.687
He came to the train tracks.

23:58.821 --> 24:00.873
There's no way to treat her.

24:00.986 --> 24:03.364
Just one minute will do, as long as
we can show her the suspects!

24:03.418 --> 24:04.937
But what about the patient?

24:05.064 --> 24:05.971
Open you eye slowly.

24:06.058 --> 24:09.176
Is the man you saw one of these men?

24:10.501 --> 24:11.288
That's the man!

24:11.683 --> 24:14.370
Next Karte - The Witness of a Brief Moment.

24:15.193 --> 24:16.876
Karte NG...

24:17.878 --> 24:20.980
You must be... Uh...

24:21.674 --> 24:23.425
You forgot your line?

24:23.484 --> 24:24.520
Sorry.
